{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>天文台於今日下午4時15分發出特別天氣提示，預測受冷鋒隨後的強烈東北季候風及一道雲雨帶影響，本港未來一兩日天氣將顯著轉涼。星期五天氣多雲並有幾陣雨，市區氣溫將由午夜約18度下降至最低約15度，新界地區氣溫更低兩至三度，內陸地區及高地將感到寒冷。\n</p>\n<p>此外，星期五及星期六初時將出現明顯的風寒效應，市民需特別注意保暖，尤其是進行戶外活動時。天文台提醒市民關注天氣變化，並特別關顧長者及慢性病患者，以防寒冷天氣對健康造成影響。</p>\n<p>請市民密切留意天氣預報，並採取適當的防寒措施，確保安全。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%86%b7%e9%8b%92/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">冷鋒</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a9%e6%96%87%e5%8f%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">天文台</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e5%a4%a9%e6%b0%a3%e6%8f%90%e7%a4%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特別天氣提示</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 18 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T09:04:14.480523+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":274,"images":0,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T08:45:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T10:17:31.033518+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T08:57:23.615680+00:00","content_hash":"4ff4474704bacb0fd7afdd7f5e16ab8de80059a75ee48957ff3a2db4336bae4a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}